cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BEACON in academic work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "BEACON: Bearing-based Estimation, Active Colour landmark hOming, and Navigation"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 Humble simulation stack in which a TurtleBot 3 Waffle explores a Gazebo Classic
  arena, detects coloured landmark blocks with its depth camera, builds a landmark map with
  an EKF-SLAM filter, and then navigates to whichever colour it is asked for while avoiding
  two roaming obstacles. The whole stack runs on a single machine with no hardware
  dependency.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Zhuqiben"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Zhuqiben/beacon"
url: "https://github.com/Zhuqiben/beacon"
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-16
